<title>FRANCE: France sells wheat flour in food aid tender.</title>
<headline>France sells wheat flour in food aid tender.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>France sold a total of 3,650 tonnes of soft wheat flour at a food aid tender it held on March 18, national grain office ONIC said on Thursday.</p>
<p>It sold 2,190 tonnes of flour to Liberia and a further 1,460 tonnes to Mauritania at 1,685 francs per tonne, Fob Montoir.</p>
<p>The flour is for shipment between April 1 and April 30 and comes under the World Food programme. --Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
</text>
